{"seq":4,"slug":"protocol-witness-table","title":"协议见证表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/protocol-witness-table","wordCount":1027,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"协议见证表\">协议见证表</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>协议见证表（Protocol Witness Table, PWT）是 Swift 实现协议多态的底层机制。当一个值通过协议类型（存在类型）使用时，编译器通过见证表找到具体类型对应的方法实现。理解见证表的结构和存在容器（Existential Container）的内存布局，对于分析 Swift 的性能特征至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PWT[&quot;协议见证表 PWT&quot;] --&gt; MS[&quot;方法映射&quot;]&#10;    PWT --&gt; AT[&quot;关联类型映射&quot;]&#10;    EC[&quot;存在容器&quot;] --&gt; VB[&quot;值缓冲区 (3 words)&quot;]&#10;    EC --&gt; VWT[&quot;Value Witness Table&quot;]&#10;    EC --&gt; PWT&#10;    VWT --&gt; ALLOC[&quot;allocate&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; COPY[&quot;copy&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; DEST[&quot;destroy&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; SIZE[&quot;size/stride/alignment&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    PWT[\"协议见证表 PWT\"] --&gt; MS[\"方法映射\"]\n    PWT --&gt; AT[\"关联类型映射\"]\n    EC[\"存在容器\"] --&gt; VB[\"值缓冲区 (3 words)\"]\n    EC --&gt; VWT[\"Value Witness Table\"]\n    EC --&gt; PWT\n    VWT --&gt; ALLOC[\"allocate\"]\n    VWT --&gt; COPY[\"copy\"]\n    VWT --&gt; DEST[\"destroy\"]\n    VWT --&gt; SIZE[\"size/stride/alignment\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协议见证表（Protocol Witness Table, PWT）是 Swift 协议多态在<strong>运行时</strong>的落地机制。协议方法本身没有实现，当值以协议类型（存在类型）使用时，运行时必须知道「这个方法该跳到哪个具体实现」——PWT 正是这张映射表。理解它需要同时把握几个相互关联的运行时结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协议见证表（PWT）</strong>——每个「类型 × 协议」组合生成一张表，把协议要求的每个方法/属性映射到该类型的具体实现；</li>\n<li><strong>存在容器（Existential Container）</strong>——<code>any Protocol</code> 值的内存载体，固定 5 个机器字：3 字值缓冲区 + VWT 指针 + PWT 指针；</li>\n<li><strong>Value Witness Table（VWT）</strong>——记录类型的通用值操作（初始化、拷贝、销毁、大小/步长/对齐），使运行时可对未知类型执行通用操作；</li>\n<li><strong>内联存储优化</strong>——值 ≤24 字节内联于值缓冲区，超出则堆分配，直接影响 <code>any</code> 的性能；</li>\n<li><strong>多协议遵循</strong>——每多遵循一个协议，存在容器就多一个 PWT 指针（+8 字节）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一整套机制解释了为什么 <code>any</code> 存在运行时开销，而泛型特化后可以接近直接调用的性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"见证表结构\">见证表结构</h2><p>每当一个类型遵循一个协议时，编译器会生成一张见证表，将协议要求的每个方法映射到具体类型的实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Drawable {&#10;    func draw()&#10;    var color: String { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Circle: Drawable {&#10;    func draw() { print(&quot;Drawing circle&quot;) }&#10;    var color: String { &quot;red&quot; }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Square: Drawable {&#10;    func draw() { print(&quot;Drawing square&quot;) }&#10;    var color: String { &quot;blue&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Drawable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Drawable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Drawing circle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"red\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Drawable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Drawing square\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器为 <code>Circle: Drawable</code> 和 <code>Square: Drawable</code> 各生成一张见证表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PWT 条目</th>\n<th>Circle 的见证</th>\n<th>Square 的见证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>draw()</code></td>\n<td><code>Circle.draw</code></td>\n<td><code>Square.draw</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>color.getter</code></td>\n<td><code>Circle.color.getter</code></td>\n<td><code>Square.color.getter</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Circle: Drawable PWT&quot;&#10;        C1[&quot;draw → Circle.draw&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;color → Circle.color&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Square: Drawable PWT&quot;&#10;        S1[&quot;draw → Square.draw&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;color → Square.color&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Circle: Drawable PWT\"\n        C1[\"draw → Circle.draw\"]\n        C2[\"color → Circle.color\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Square: Drawable PWT\"\n        S1[\"draw → Square.draw\"]\n        S2[\"color → Square.color\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"存在容器-existential-container\">存在容器（Existential Container）</h2><p>当值存储在协议类型变量中时，使用存在容器包装：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let shape: any Drawable = Circle()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shape: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Drawable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>存在容器的内存布局（64 位系统）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"block\" data-source=\"block-beta&#10;    columns 1&#10;    W0[&quot;值缓冲区 Word 0 - 8 bytes&quot;]&#10;    W1[&quot;值缓冲区 Word 1 - 8 bytes&quot;]&#10;    W2[&quot;值缓冲区 Word 2 - 8 bytes&quot;]&#10;    VWT_PTR[&quot;Value Witness Table 指针 - 8 bytes&quot;]&#10;    PWT_PTR[&quot;Protocol Witness Table 指针 - 8 bytes&quot;]\">block-beta\n    columns 1\n    W0[\"值缓冲区 Word 0 - 8 bytes\"]\n    W1[\"值缓冲区 Word 1 - 8 bytes\"]\n    W2[\"值缓冲区 Word 2 - 8 bytes\"]\n    VWT_PTR[\"Value Witness Table 指针 - 8 bytes\"]\n    PWT_PTR[\"Protocol Witness Table 指针 - 8 bytes\"]</pre><p>总计：40 bytes (5 words)</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol HasSize {&#10;    var size: Int { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct SmallValue: HasSize {&#10;    let a: Int&#10;    var size: Int { MemoryLayout&lt;Self&gt;.size } // 8 bytes, 内联&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct LargeValue: HasSize {&#10;    let a, b, c, d: Int&#10;    var size: Int { MemoryLayout&lt;Self&gt;.size } // 32 bytes, 堆分配&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HasSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SmallValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HasSize </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MemoryLayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 8 bytes, 内联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LargeValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HasSize </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b, c, d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MemoryLayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 32 bytes, 堆分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值大小</th>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>性能影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤ 24 bytes（3 words）</td>\n<td>值缓冲区内联存储</td>\n<td>无堆分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 24 bytes</td>\n<td>堆分配，缓冲区存指针</td>\n<td>引入堆分配开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"value-witness-table\">Value Witness Table</h2><p>除了协议见证表，每个类型还有一个 Value Witness Table（VWT），记录了类型的值操作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    VWT[&quot;Value Witness Table&quot;] --&gt; INIT[&quot;initializeWithCopy&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; ASSIGN[&quot;assignWithCopy&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; DESTR[&quot;destroy&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; SZ[&quot;size&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; STRD[&quot;stride&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; ALGN[&quot;alignment&quot;]&#10;    VWT --&gt; FLGS[&quot;flags (内联/堆分配)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    VWT[\"Value Witness Table\"] --&gt; INIT[\"initializeWithCopy\"]\n    VWT --&gt; ASSIGN[\"assignWithCopy\"]\n    VWT --&gt; DESTR[\"destroy\"]\n    VWT --&gt; SZ[\"size\"]\n    VWT --&gt; STRD[\"stride\"]\n    VWT --&gt; ALGN[\"alignment\"]\n    VWT --&gt; FLGS[\"flags (内联/堆分配)\"]</pre><p>VWT 使得运行时能够对不同大小和对齐要求的值执行通用操作（拷贝、移动、销毁），而无需在编译时确定具体类型。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内联存储优化\">内联存储优化</h2><p>Swift 运行时对小值执行内联存储优化，避免堆分配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Valuable {&#10;    func worth() -&gt; Double&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Coin: Valuable {&#10;    let cents: Int&#10;    func worth() -&gt; Double { Double(cents) / 100.0 }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct GoldBar: Valuable {&#10;    let weightOz: Double&#10;    let purity: Double&#10;    let serialNumber: UInt64&#10;    let vaultID: UInt64&#10;    func worth() -&gt; Double { weightOz * purity * 2000.0 }&#10;}&#10;&#10;var item: any Valuable&#10;&#10;item = Coin(cents: 25)       // 内联存储（8 bytes ≤ 24 bytes）&#10;item = GoldBar(               // 堆分配（32 bytes &gt; 24 bytes）&#10;    weightOz: 1.0,&#10;    purity: 0.999,&#10;    serialNumber: 12345,&#10;    vaultID: 67890&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Valuable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Coin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Valuable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cents: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cents) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GoldBar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Valuable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weightOz: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> purity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serialNumber: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UInt64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vaultID: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UInt64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { weightOz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> purity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Valuable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Coin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内联存储（8 bytes ≤ 24 bytes）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GoldBar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 堆分配（32 bytes > 24 bytes）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    weightOz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    purity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.999</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    serialNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12345</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    vaultID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">67890</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在性能敏感的代码中，保持协议遵循类型的大小在 3 个机器字以内，可以避免存在容器的堆分配。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多协议遵循的存在容器\">多协议遵循的存在容器</h2><p>当类型遵循多个协议时，存在容器会包含多个 PWT 指针：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let item: any Drawable &amp; Hashable = Circle()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Drawable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Hashable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"block\" data-source=\"block-beta&#10;    columns 1&#10;    VB[&quot;值缓冲区 (3 words) - 24 bytes&quot;]&#10;    VWT_PTR[&quot;Value Witness Table 指针 - 8 bytes&quot;]&#10;    DPWT[&quot;Drawable PWT 指针 - 8 bytes&quot;]&#10;    HPWT[&quot;Hashable PWT 指针 - 8 bytes&quot;]\">block-beta\n    columns 1\n    VB[\"值缓冲区 (3 words) - 24 bytes\"]\n    VWT_PTR[\"Value Witness Table 指针 - 8 bytes\"]\n    DPWT[\"Drawable PWT 指针 - 8 bytes\"]\n    HPWT[\"Hashable PWT 指针 - 8 bytes\"]</pre><p>总计：48 bytes (6 words)</p>\n<p>每多遵循一个协议，存在容器就增加一个 PWT 指针（8 bytes）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能影响分析\">性能影响分析</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func sumDirect(_ values: [Int]) -&gt; Int {&#10;    values.reduce(0, +)&#10;}&#10;&#10;func sumExistential(_ values: [any Numeric]) -&gt; any Numeric {&#10;    var result: any Numeric = 0&#10;    for value in values {&#10;        // 每次迭代：VWT 查找 + PWT 间接调用&#10;    }&#10;    return result&#10;}&#10;&#10;func sumGeneric&lt;T: Numeric&gt;(_ values: [T]) -&gt; T {&#10;    values.reduce(0, +)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumDirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    values.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumExistential</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Numeric]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Numeric {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Numeric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 每次迭代：VWT 查找 + PWT 间接调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumGeneric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values: [T]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    values.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>分派开销</th>\n<th>内存开销</th>\n<th>编译器优化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接类型</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>完全优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型（<code>some</code>/<code>T</code>）</td>\n<td>可特化为直接</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>特化后完全优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在类型（<code>any</code>）</td>\n<td>PWT 间接调用</td>\n<td>存在容器（40+bytes）</td>\n<td>优化受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;性能由高到低&quot;&#10;        D[&quot;直接类型调用&quot;] --&gt; G[&quot;泛型(特化后)&quot;]&#10;        G --&gt; E[&quot;存在类型 any&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"性能由高到低\"\n        D[\"直接类型调用\"] --&gt; G[\"泛型(特化后)\"]\n        G --&gt; E[\"存在类型 any\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类类型的特殊处理\">类类型的特殊处理</h2><p>类类型遵循协议时，存在容器直接存放引用（指针），无需值缓冲区的内联/堆分配区分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"class Animal: Drawable {&#10;    func draw() { }&#10;    var color: String { &quot;brown&quot; }&#10;}&#10;&#10;let animal: any Drawable = Animal()&#10;// 存在容器的值缓冲区直接存放 Animal 的引用（1 word）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Animal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Drawable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> animal: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Drawable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Animal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 存在容器的值缓冲区直接存放 Animal 的引用（1 word）</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>**协议见证表（PWT）**将协议方法映射到具体类型实现，是 Swift 协议多态的底层机制</li>\n<li><strong>存在容器</strong>固定 5 words（40 bytes），包含值缓冲区、VWT 指针和 PWT 指针</li>\n<li>值 ≤ 24 bytes 时<strong>内联存储</strong>，&gt; 24 bytes 时<strong>堆分配</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Value Witness Table</strong> 提供类型的通用值操作（拷贝、销毁、大小信息）</li>\n<li>多协议遵循的存在容器会包含多个 PWT 指针</li>\n<li>性能排序：直接类型 &gt; 泛型特化 &gt; 存在类型（<code>any</code>），性能敏感场景应优先使用泛型</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协议见证表","id":"协议见证表"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"见证表结构","id":"见证表结构"},{"level":2,"text":"存在容器（Existential Container）","id":"存在容器-existential-container"},{"level":2,"text":"Value Witness Table","id":"value-witness-table"},{"level":2,"text":"内联存储优化","id":"内联存储优化"},{"level":2,"text":"多协议遵循的存在容器","id":"多协议遵循的存在容器"},{"level":2,"text":"性能影响分析","id":"性能影响分析"},{"level":2,"text":"类类型的特殊处理","id":"类类型的特殊处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"条件遵循","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/conditional-conformance"},"next":{"title":"async/await 异步等待","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/async-await"}}